  npcName: Wandering Stranger
  npcSprite: {fileID: 0}
  dialogue:
  - You there... heading to the castle?
  - The king is in the castle to the northeast.
  - Guards are everywhere. The door has a cipher lock.
  - No one has cracked it yet. It is a suicide mission.
  - I have heard rumours though...
  - Monks in a hidden village to the north. They might help.
  - Probably just old tales. But worth a look.
  - Good luck. You will need it.
